> A hand-checkable calculation

With next values2,4 and reward1, sampled SARSA after choosing action0 gives2.8; expected SARSA under epsilon.1 gives4.51; Q-learning gives4.6. These are different targets, not interchangeable estimates.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/sarsa_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
