> Complete preserved experiment

The source compares500 episodes over20 runs per method with alpha.5, epsilon.1 and gamma1. Online rewards and greedy evaluations remain distinct: a shortest greedy path can incur costly cliff falls during exploration. All objectives, policy improvements, optimizer steps, collection and evaluation loops remain editable below. Additional checkpoint writes consume no RNG draws. Playback retains the original seeded episode computations; external videos are omitted.

```{cpp, results="output", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
namespace report_capture {
